<title>MALAYSIA: Tenaga starts restructuring - minister.</title>
<headline>Tenaga starts restructuring - minister.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian power giant Tenaga Nasional Bhd is implementing a restructuring plan to divide its activities into generation, transmission and distribution, Energy, Telecommunications and Posts Minister Leo Moggie said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;They are implementing some form of restructuring Tenaga's activities, and the Board of Directors had already decided on it. I have been informed about it sometime ago,&quot; Moggie told reporters after opening a telecommunications seminar.</p>
</text>
